{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgowXsGb5nGGKzoXJRoU1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**My answer:** I didn't pick anything today. If I had to, I'd go with an S&P 500 track at a big name I know, like מיטב \"גמל עוקב מדד S&P500\" (fee 0.53%, about 13.89% over 3 years) or the one at הפניקס. But I'm not sure. What stopped me: there are 182 tracks, and they all look the same once you get past the first few rows.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **First screen.** The big heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\" and the tab \"תגמולים ואישית לפיצויים 182\" told me I was in the right place.\n- **The filter buttons.** There's a whole wall of them (\"עוקב מדד s&p 500 12\", \"מניות 12\", \"הלכה\"...). I didn't press any.\n- **The table.** I scrolled down. It's grouped by company: מיטב, then מור, then הפניקס, אלטשולר שחם and כלל. I mostly looked at the big % numbers. \"גמל משולב סחר\" at מיטב shows 28.61% for 3 years, and the מניות tracks show about 22%. That made my eyes light up. But I came for the S&P, and the S&P rows sit around 13–14% everywhere, with fees of 0.47%–0.67%. They all look alike to me.\n- **Where I quit.** Around the כלל group, roughly a third of the way down, I got bored. I jumped to the bottom to see if the page recommends anything. All it says is that returns are before fees and \"אין מיון לפיה\". So it doesn't recommend anything, and I'd close it there.\n\n**What I skipped:**\n- The orange notice at the top\n- The small text under the heading\n- The filter chips\n- The ⓘ marks\n- Everything between the כלל group and the footer\n\n**Words I didn't get:**\n- \"ההפקדה\" next to the fee, and how it's different from \"החיסכון\"\n- \"חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח\"\n- \"מט\"ח\"\n- \"עוד לא דווח\"\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\"\n- \"הלכה יהודי\"\n- \"מבטיח תשואה\"\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- Some tracks show \"101%\" or \"103%\" for stocks or מט\"ח. How can it be more than 100%?\n- The fee \"ההפקדה 0%\" next to \"החיסכון 